{"4203270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moon Crashers", "steam_appid": 4203270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4768650], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong><br>Only teamwork  stands between you and your way back home to beloved earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/7b82ffabb2530776a645bf050c4368ce.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/7b82ffabb2530776a645bf050c4368ce.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/7b82ffabb2530776a645bf050c4368ce.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER</strong><br>Scramble across a deadly lunar playground of deep canyons, endless craters. Hunt for ship scraps and raw materials that you'll need to build your way back to earth. One bad weld and your rocket becomes the galaxy’s biggest firework.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/21042d759e6af92f058354dd9242ec74.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/21042d759e6af92f058354dd9242ec74.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/21042d759e6af92f058354dd9242ec74.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIFT, FLY AND GRAPPLE</strong> <br>Hop into janky moon buggies that drift like soap on ice and gather giant parts.<br>Or fire up your jetpack to leap canyons<br>and definitely face-plant spectacularly.<strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/d285793be73e32a4f8ee30180fc817fc.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/d285793be73e32a4f8ee30180fc817fc.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/d285793be73e32a4f8ee30180fc817fc.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REBUILD</strong>  <br>Scramble across a deadly lunar playground of deep canyons, endless craters. Hunt for ship scraps and rare materials that you'll need to build your way back to earth. A bad weld and your rocket becomes the galaxy’s biggest firework.<strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/00978f4695904392669d2e73c757f0d8.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/00978f4695904392669d2e73c757f0d8.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/00978f4695904392669d2e73c757f0d8.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong> <br>Your spacesuit is all that keeps instant agony away. Watch your steps, mind the low gravity, and pray your buddies don’t “accidentally” vent you into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRASHING IS BETTER WITH FRIENDS</strong><br>Friends-only chaos: invite up to three friends via Steam and find your way home together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly lunar zones packed with hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks &amp; grappling hooks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild moon rovers, Trucks and Bikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret lunar locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op (and solo if you dare)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong><br>Only teamwork  stands between you and your way back home to beloved earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/7b82ffabb2530776a645bf050c4368ce.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/7b82ffabb2530776a645bf050c4368ce.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/7b82ffabb2530776a645bf050c4368ce.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER</strong><br>Scramble across a deadly lunar playground of deep canyons, endless craters. Hunt for ship scraps and raw materials that you'll need to build your way back to earth. One bad weld and your rocket becomes the galaxy’s biggest firework.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/21042d759e6af92f058354dd9242ec74.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/21042d759e6af92f058354dd9242ec74.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/21042d759e6af92f058354dd9242ec74.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIFT, FLY AND GRAPPLE</strong> <br>Hop into janky moon buggies that drift like soap on ice and gather giant parts.<br>Or fire up your jetpack to leap canyons<br>and definitely face-plant spectacularly.<strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/d285793be73e32a4f8ee30180fc817fc.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/d285793be73e32a4f8ee30180fc817fc.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/d285793be73e32a4f8ee30180fc817fc.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REBUILD</strong>  <br>Scramble across a deadly lunar playground of deep canyons, endless craters. Hunt for ship scraps and rare materials that you'll need to build your way back to earth. A bad weld and your rocket becomes the galaxy’s biggest firework.<strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/00978f4695904392669d2e73c757f0d8.poster.avif?t=1785171633\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/00978f4695904392669d2e73c757f0d8.webm?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203270/extras/00978f4695904392669d2e73c757f0d8.mp4?t=1785171633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong> <br>Your spacesuit is all that keeps instant agony away. Watch your steps, mind the low gravity, and pray your buddies don’t “accidentally” vent you into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRASHING IS BETTER WITH FRIENDS</strong><br>Friends-only chaos: invite up to three friends via Steam and find your way home together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly lunar zones packed with hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks &amp; grappling hooks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild moon rovers, Trucks and Bikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret lunar locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op (and solo if you dare)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Moon Crashers is a 4-player online co-op game. Crash-land on the lunar surface with your squad, drift across craters, scavenge junk &amp; rare minerals, uncover ancient ruins, build your ride, and rocket back home. Think you can make it home?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“I don't think any of the 4 of us have had that much fun in a demo”<br>10/10 – TheTacoTim<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.s